    {
      "q": "How much does Department of Transportation spend on contracts?",
      "a": "The Department of Transportation obligated $522M in FY2027 to date. The Department of Transportation recorded 1,925 awards with an average award size of $271K. Obligations fell 96.3% year over year, and prior full fiscal-year totals were $8B (FY22), $8.7B (FY23), $8.6B (FY24), $9B (FY25), and $14.1B (FY26)."
    },
    {
      "q": "What does Transportation buy?",
